WEBVTT

00:00:00.410 --> 00:00:04.010
The battle between Jack 
and Yoshizo, Team 5D's and

00:00:04.010 --> 00:00:07.010
Team Taiyo's first Wheelers, 
is nearing its finale!

00:00:07.460 --> 00:00:10.500
Lancer Archfiend attacks Genin!

00:00:14.520 --> 00:00:18.900
A strategy that focuses on defense 
doesn't work against Jack Atlas!

00:00:18.900 --> 00:00:21.770
I set one card and end my turn!

00:00:24.400 --> 00:00:25.520
My turn!

00:00:28.450 --> 00:00:32.380
I set one card and activate 
Speed World 2's effect!

00:00:33.140 --> 00:00:39.250
By removing 4 Speed Counters, I deal 800 
points of damage for every Speed Spell in my hand!

00:00:40.840 --> 00:00:44.200
I activate the Counter Trap Crimson Fire!

00:00:44.200 --> 00:00:47.530
If you activate a spell 
that deals damage when I

00:00:47.530 --> 00:00:50.940
have Red Dragon Archfiend, 
you take double the damage!

00:00:51.930 --> 00:00:53.770
What?

00:00:59.710 --> 00:01:01.240
All right, Jack!

00:01:02.870 --> 00:01:04.210
That's why he's Jack Atlas!

00:01:04.210 --> 00:01:07.480
Team Taiyo's first Wheeler held 
tough, but Jack defeated him!

00:01:07.860 --> 00:01:10.880
You can't keep using the 
same strategy against me!

00:01:11.640 --> 00:01:12.580
All right!

00:01:12.580 --> 00:01:13.820
That's why he's Jack!

00:01:13.820 --> 00:01:15.740
It's going at Jack's pace.

00:01:23.590 --> 00:01:25.240
Riding Duels.

00:01:25.460 --> 00:01:28.320
These duels evolved in the world of speed.

00:01:28.630 --> 00:01:35.210
The people with the legendary marks who 
risked their lives were known as 5D's.

00:01:50.360 --> 00:01:56.530
Reach out your hand and 
grab a bright tomorrow

00:01:56.760 --> 00:02:06.640
Soar in the infinite skies  BELIEVE IN NEXUS

00:02:07.270 --> 00:02:12.880
No one can stop my wild impulses

00:02:13.240 --> 00:02:18.850
My hand sweats as the battle 
intensifies  This Heart Beat

00:02:19.380 --> 00:02:24.620
I can't avoid this fearsome battle

00:02:24.860 --> 00:02:30.230
I don't want it to end here  Go For It!!

00:02:31.330 --> 00:02:36.630
Stand up  Don't tremble in fear alone

00:02:36.770 --> 00:02:42.410
Remember that you have 
friends waiting for you

00:02:42.640 --> 00:02:48.710
I'm not scared and I'll never give 
up, no matter how powerful the enemy

00:02:48.710 --> 00:02:55.020
With real courage, I'll never lose

00:03:18.640 --> 00:03:24.150
Pass On the Feelings!
Hand-Holding Genie

00:03:28.130 --> 00:03:30.910
Just as I thought, Team 5D's is strong.

00:03:34.230 --> 00:03:37.960
I'm sorry.  I thought I could've 
hung in there for a bit longer.

00:03:38.410 --> 00:03:41.670
It's fine.  It fits our battling style.

00:03:41.670 --> 00:03:45.360
Jack Atlas returns to the home straight!

00:03:47.680 --> 00:03:49.160
We're counting on you, Jin!

00:03:49.260 --> 00:03:50.420
Leave it to me!

00:03:57.210 --> 00:03:59.180
Here I go, Jack Atlas!

00:04:00.160 --> 00:04:01.020
Duel!

00:04:01.440 --> 00:04:06.310
Is their strategy to take their time, slowly 
shave away my life points and annoy me?

00:04:06.850 --> 00:04:09.160
In that case, I'll finish you in an instant!

00:04:09.420 --> 00:04:12.520
I summon Hand-Holding 
Genie in defense position!

00:04:13.760 --> 00:04:16.190
What?  It's the same strategy again!

00:04:16.190 --> 00:04:22.420
This card gains defense points equal to the total 
defense points of my monsters in defense position!

00:04:24.240 --> 00:04:26.980
What?  He brought out the same card again!

00:04:26.980 --> 00:04:29.810
Stop bringing out those ordinary cards!

00:04:29.810 --> 00:04:32.090
Give us a duel that's worth watching!

00:04:32.430 --> 00:04:33.990
Stop messing around!

00:04:34.150 --> 00:04:36.380
What do you hope to accomplish by stalling?

00:04:39.450 --> 00:04:43.430
I'm wrong!  His eyes say 
that he's not stalling!

00:04:44.170 --> 00:04:45.930
What's their goal?

00:04:46.650 --> 00:04:47.920
I end my turn!

00:04:48.790 --> 00:04:51.090
If they're not stalling...

00:04:51.820 --> 00:04:56.010
There's a reason why they 
want more turns to pass.

00:04:56.010 --> 00:04:57.550
But what is it?

00:04:58.860 --> 00:05:00.260
My turn!

00:05:02.600 --> 00:05:03.710
This is…

00:05:04.670 --> 00:05:06.470
I don't know their strategy.

00:05:07.270 --> 00:05:13.470
But my instincts tell me that the more 
turns that pass, the more it helps them.

00:05:14.770 --> 00:05:16.600
I set two cards.

00:05:16.600 --> 00:05:20.050
Due to Red Dragon Archfiend's 
effect, all my monsters

00:05:20.050 --> 00:05:23.840
that didn't attack are destroyed 
during the End Phase.

00:05:25.420 --> 00:05:26.600
I end my turn!

00:05:30.090 --> 00:05:35.390
Due to Hand-Holding Genie's effect, 
Jack can't attack any other monster.

00:05:35.540 --> 00:05:39.540
Red Dragon Archfiend's effect would destroy 
all monsters in defense position...

00:05:40.050 --> 00:05:43.850
...but the Continuous Trap 
Scrum Force stops it.

00:05:43.850 --> 00:05:48.520
Since Jack has fewer attack points, 
he'll take damage if he attacks.

00:05:48.930 --> 00:05:50.900
It's a difficult choice.

00:05:50.900 --> 00:05:52.000
Jack…

00:05:52.290 --> 00:05:55.970
How long are they going to 
battle using the same cards?

00:05:56.340 --> 00:05:59.240
Their battling style worries me.

00:05:59.470 --> 00:06:01.450
How?

00:06:01.870 --> 00:06:07.220
Team Taiyo is surviving Jack's 
attacks by using greater power.

00:06:07.370 --> 00:06:10.250
But they can't win if they just survive.

00:06:10.250 --> 00:06:13.410
Does that mean they have a secret strategy?

00:06:13.660 --> 00:06:18.430
Yeah.  They didn't come here to lose.

00:06:18.620 --> 00:06:21.430
But Team Taiyo's deck...

00:06:21.430 --> 00:06:24.660
They don't have any cards 
for a secret strategy.

00:06:25.200 --> 00:06:28.450
What are they planning to do?

00:06:29.150 --> 00:06:30.560
This isn't fun!

00:06:30.560 --> 00:06:31.750
Be more exciting!

00:06:32.700 --> 00:06:37.920
Is our dueling style too 
cornball for city folk?

00:06:38.340 --> 00:06:39.510
It doesn't matter!

00:06:39.510 --> 00:06:42.110
We fight how we want.

00:06:42.540 --> 00:06:45.750
So let's believe in ourselves and fight.

00:06:46.510 --> 00:06:48.080
You're right!

00:06:48.490 --> 00:06:52.860
That's right!  We believe 
in our fighting style!

00:06:55.130 --> 00:06:59.800
Whatever!  We can't win 
with this garbage deck!

00:06:59.800 --> 00:07:00.600
Jin!

00:07:00.690 --> 00:07:01.400
Jin!

00:07:02.000 --> 00:07:04.130
I can't stay in this town!

00:07:04.460 --> 00:07:07.700
I'll go to the city and 
get the strongest deck!

00:07:15.440 --> 00:07:18.580
We're just like this deck.

00:07:18.580 --> 00:07:22.210
You can find these cards 
anywhere.  However…

00:07:22.880 --> 00:07:28.090
As long as we believe in our friends 
and our power, we'll always win!

00:07:28.360 --> 00:07:30.220
I have a secret strategy!

00:07:31.180 --> 00:07:34.540
Secret strategy?  Whatever.

00:07:39.860 --> 00:07:42.570
Thanks for your help!  You're handy!

00:07:42.570 --> 00:07:45.410
You've never changed a tire before?

00:07:45.410 --> 00:07:47.120
Of course not.

00:07:51.480 --> 00:07:54.740
As thanks, why don't you come to my villa?

00:07:54.740 --> 00:07:56.820
I have a tennis court and a pool.

00:07:58.640 --> 00:08:02.970
If I didn't run into him, 
I'd be a mummy by now!

00:08:03.080 --> 00:08:05.880
Mitsuru, you always exaggerate.

00:08:05.880 --> 00:08:08.930
I admire people who are good with machines.

00:08:08.930 --> 00:08:11.800
Can you fix the air conditioner 
on the second floor?

00:08:11.800 --> 00:08:12.900
C'mon now.

00:08:16.860 --> 00:08:19.180
I fixed it by cleaning the sensor.

00:08:19.180 --> 00:08:21.110
Really?  I'm so happy!

00:08:23.580 --> 00:08:29.010
It's a rare card, but I don't like it.

00:08:29.230 --> 00:08:31.460
You don't duel much anyway.

00:08:31.690 --> 00:08:35.960
Since it's a present from your girlfriend, 
you should happily accept it.

00:08:35.960 --> 00:08:37.000
I guess.

00:08:37.590 --> 00:08:40.090
City folk really are incredible.

00:08:40.350 --> 00:08:44.480
They can easily acquire the strongest cards!

00:08:53.750 --> 00:08:57.430
I wonder if they're having a 
hard time because I'm gone…

00:09:04.060 --> 00:09:05.030
All right...

00:09:05.260 --> 00:09:06.450
Be careful!

00:09:09.670 --> 00:09:11.600
How dare you!

00:09:13.160 --> 00:09:14.680
Sorry.

00:09:14.680 --> 00:09:15.730
What did you say?

00:09:15.880 --> 00:09:16.560
What happened?

00:09:20.050 --> 00:09:21.760
I'm sorry!

00:09:25.070 --> 00:09:27.720
Stop!

00:09:35.840 --> 00:09:38.610
He's the one who crashed into you!

00:09:38.880 --> 00:09:40.990
Aren't you going to stop?

00:09:40.990 --> 00:09:42.750
You must be kidding!

00:09:47.500 --> 00:09:48.890
What are you doing?

00:09:49.440 --> 00:09:51.310
You're going to abandon your friends?

00:09:51.470 --> 00:09:54.540
Abandon?  Our only choice is to flee!

00:09:54.540 --> 00:09:55.840
If you flee…

00:09:58.830 --> 00:10:01.890
If you flee, you'll lose your friends!

00:10:02.110 --> 00:10:03.380
Are you fine with that?

00:10:03.670 --> 00:10:06.780
I can make more friends.

00:10:06.780 --> 00:10:07.920
You're wrong!

00:10:07.920 --> 00:10:11.570
Once you lose them, you'll 
never get them again!

00:10:14.390 --> 00:10:15.960
Stop it!

00:10:17.810 --> 00:10:18.700
You're…

00:10:19.430 --> 00:10:21.730
We were wrong!  Forgive us!

00:10:21.830 --> 00:10:22.930
I beg of you!

00:10:23.360 --> 00:10:25.200
What's with you?

00:10:25.200 --> 00:10:26.630
Are you making fun of us?

00:10:27.620 --> 00:10:30.890
No…  Let's have peace.

00:10:31.950 --> 00:10:33.340
Stop messing around!

00:10:34.330 --> 00:10:35.470
It's Security!

00:10:36.180 --> 00:10:40.670
This is the Public Maintenance Department.  
You're completely surrounded.

00:10:43.800 --> 00:10:48.330
Hurry up and flee.  If you flee, 
we're willing to forgive you.

00:10:48.980 --> 00:10:50.090
They found us!

00:10:50.190 --> 00:10:52.210
You punks!

00:10:52.210 --> 00:10:53.050
Taro!  Yoshi!

00:10:53.050 --> 00:10:54.750
I won't forgive you!

00:10:56.510 --> 00:10:57.690
Get on, Jin!

00:10:59.500 --> 00:11:00.530
You punk!

00:11:00.690 --> 00:11:01.840
You guys!

00:11:01.840 --> 00:11:03.140
We've been looking for you, Jin!

00:11:03.140 --> 00:11:05.010
Stop making trouble.

00:11:05.010 --> 00:11:05.880
They're coming!

00:11:07.040 --> 00:11:08.570
Stop!

00:11:26.290 --> 00:11:28.820
We managed to escape.

00:11:30.940 --> 00:11:37.940
I told you that as long as we believe in our 
friends and our power, we'll always win.

00:11:39.280 --> 00:11:42.680
What do you mean, win?  We just ran away.

00:11:42.950 --> 00:11:45.180
No, it's a victory.

00:11:45.180 --> 00:11:48.310
We found you and escaped.

00:11:48.300 --> 00:11:50.650
That means our plan was a success!

00:11:53.270 --> 00:11:54.420
I guess.

00:12:06.640 --> 00:12:08.530
This is your secret strategy?

00:12:09.440 --> 00:12:11.090
This is our hope?

00:12:11.090 --> 00:12:12.000
Yeah!

00:12:15.550 --> 00:12:19.960
It's a secret strategy 
that only we can execute.

00:12:20.140 --> 00:12:21.980
Yeah, you're right!

00:12:23.970 --> 00:12:25.970
Team Taiyo.

00:12:27.750 --> 00:12:29.350
That's the name of our team.

00:12:29.530 --> 00:12:31.450
Team Taiyo?

00:12:31.670 --> 00:12:35.770
No matter how many times the sun sets, 
it always rises again and shines!

00:12:36.860 --> 00:12:38.810
We'll become the sun!

00:12:39.370 --> 00:12:41.130
We're Team Taiyo!

00:12:41.600 --> 00:12:43.780
Yeah!  Team Taiyo!

00:12:43.780 --> 00:12:45.990
We're Team Taiyo!

00:12:49.270 --> 00:12:50.330
Let me join in!

00:12:55.590 --> 00:13:01.530
That's right!  As long as we believe in our 
friends and our power, we'll always win!

00:13:01.530 --> 00:13:03.690
That's how Team Taiyo duels!

00:13:03.960 --> 00:13:05.170
My turn!

00:13:07.420 --> 00:13:09.960
I summon Zarigun in defense position!

00:13:12.770 --> 00:13:16.890
Due to Hand-Holding Genie's effect, 
it gains Zarigun's defense points!

00:13:20.170 --> 00:13:22.910
I set one card and end my turn!

00:13:23.440 --> 00:13:27.430
Team Taiyo increased their 
defense points again!

00:13:27.700 --> 00:13:29.950
You're going to keep doing that?

00:13:30.320 --> 00:13:31.660
My turn!

00:13:33.680 --> 00:13:35.960
I activate Speed World 2's effect!

00:13:36.150 --> 00:13:36.920
This is bad!

00:13:37.080 --> 00:13:41.760
I remove 10 Speed Counters 
to destroy Scrum Force!

00:13:42.510 --> 00:13:43.680
I won't let you do that!

00:13:43.860 --> 00:13:46.160
I activate the trap Fake Trap!

00:13:46.470 --> 00:13:50.560
By destroying this card, the 
other trap card isn't destroyed!

00:13:51.110 --> 00:13:52.300
There's no doubt.

00:13:52.440 --> 00:13:56.480
They're stretching out this 
duel in order to do something.

00:13:56.740 --> 00:13:57.280
In that case…

00:13:57.830 --> 00:14:00.200
I activate the trap Overgain!

00:14:00.460 --> 00:14:04.560
One monster on my field 
gains 1000 attack points!

00:14:08.360 --> 00:14:13.710
Since this is a team battle, having Crow's 
quickness handle the fight is the optimal strategy!

00:14:13.830 --> 00:14:16.970
I activate the trap Shockwave!

00:14:17.110 --> 00:14:20.290
By destroying one monster on my field, both

00:14:20.290 --> 00:14:24.410
players take damage equal to 
that monster's attack points!

00:14:28.630 --> 00:14:31.860
Jack destroyed Red Dragon Archfiend?

00:14:31.860 --> 00:14:38.150
He used Overgain to increase it to 4000 attack 
points so that he could deal that amount of damage.

00:14:39.320 --> 00:14:40.600
I refuse to lose!

00:14:40.600 --> 00:14:43.620
I activate the trap Gift of the Mystical Elf!

00:14:47.820 --> 00:14:52.830
I gain life points equal to the number of 
monsters on the field multiplied by 300 points!

00:14:52.830 --> 00:14:53.850
What?

00:14:55.470 --> 00:15:00.170
Team Taiyo survived Jack Atlas's 
self-sacrifice strategy!

00:15:00.160 --> 00:15:01.410
No way!

00:15:01.410 --> 00:15:02.130
Damn!

00:15:04.450 --> 00:15:06.450
Their defense has been solid so far.

00:15:07.060 --> 00:15:08.890
What's going to happen next?

00:15:12.090 --> 00:15:14.210
Jack rushed into that attack.

00:15:14.350 --> 00:15:15.490
That's not like him!

00:15:15.490 --> 00:15:17.910
He must have sensed something.

00:15:18.720 --> 00:15:21.530
Crow, don't let them get any more turns!

00:15:21.530 --> 00:15:23.150
Use your quickness to finish them!

00:15:25.400 --> 00:15:26.360
What do you mean?

00:15:26.640 --> 00:15:27.840
It's my intuition!

00:15:29.020 --> 00:15:31.630
I don't really understand, but I'm going!

00:15:33.540 --> 00:15:35.610
Don't let them get any more turns?

00:15:35.610 --> 00:15:38.010
Is that their secret strategy?

00:15:38.580 --> 00:15:40.780
Here I come, Team Taiyo!

00:15:42.120 --> 00:15:43.160
Duel!

00:15:44.580 --> 00:15:45.780
My turn!

00:15:46.120 --> 00:15:49.050
Quickness is the Blackwings' specialty!

00:15:49.050 --> 00:15:52.490
I summon Blackwing - Fane the Steel Chain!

00:15:55.270 --> 00:15:58.690
This card can attack you directly!

00:16:02.800 --> 00:16:05.250
I set two cards and end my turn!

00:16:06.560 --> 00:16:07.650
My turn!

00:16:08.980 --> 00:16:11.410
I activate Speed World 2's effect!

00:16:11.540 --> 00:16:18.890
Team Taiyo is using the same strategy 
against Team 5D's second Wheeler Crow!

00:16:19.480 --> 00:16:23.120
They're clearly aiming 
to have more turns pass.

00:16:23.620 --> 00:16:26.590
That must be the key to their strategy.

00:16:26.990 --> 00:16:33.420
By removing 4 Speed Counters, you take 800 
points of damage for every Speed Spell in my hand!

00:16:37.140 --> 00:16:40.030
I activate the trap Black Feather Beacon!

00:16:42.580 --> 00:16:47.520
When I take damage, I can Special Summon a 
Level 4-or-below Blackwing monster from my hand!

00:16:48.060 --> 00:16:51.490
I Special Summon Blackwing 
- Kochi the Daybreak!

00:16:51.880 --> 00:16:53.200
I end my turn!

00:16:54.950 --> 00:16:56.940
Just six more turns...

00:16:57.770 --> 00:16:59.260
My turn!

00:17:01.070 --> 00:17:04.080
I summon Blackwing – 
Jetstream the Blue Sky!

00:17:05.770 --> 00:17:07.740
Fane the Steel Chain attacks you directly!

00:17:11.070 --> 00:17:14.040
I activate the trap Urgent Tuning!

00:17:14.350 --> 00:17:17.090
Level 4 Kochi the Daybreak tunes Level 1

00:17:17.090 --> 00:17:20.610
Jetstream the Blue Sky and 
Level 2 Fane the Steel Chain!

00:17:23.440 --> 00:17:27.440
Black wind, turn into wings 
that rise to the heavens!

00:17:29.310 --> 00:17:30.590
Synchro Summon!

00:17:31.130 --> 00:17:34.160
Blackwing Armor Master!

00:17:35.100 --> 00:17:38.790
Armor Master attacks Hand-Holding Genie!

00:17:40.460 --> 00:17:44.460
Due to its monster effect, this 
card takes no damage in battle.

00:17:44.640 --> 00:17:48.680
It also places a Wedge Counter 
in the monster that it attacked!

00:17:49.030 --> 00:17:49.890
What?

00:17:50.290 --> 00:17:51.510
I end my turn!

00:17:55.730 --> 00:17:58.600
I have to hold on as long as 
possible until Taro's turn.

00:17:59.350 --> 00:18:00.580
My turn!

00:18:02.820 --> 00:18:04.600
I set one card.

00:18:05.080 --> 00:18:06.190
I end my turn!

00:18:08.810 --> 00:18:12.400
Is there nothing Team Taiyo can do?

00:18:12.400 --> 00:18:13.780
Do your best, Jin!

00:18:14.210 --> 00:18:16.570
Four more turns.

00:18:16.980 --> 00:18:20.730
Damn, we already spent 15 turns on them!

00:18:20.730 --> 00:18:23.210
A strategy that requires turns to pass...

00:18:33.190 --> 00:18:34.680
My turn!

00:18:35.880 --> 00:18:37.800
I set one card.

00:18:37.810 --> 00:18:42.050
By removing the Wedge Counter, 
your monster's attack and

00:18:42.050 --> 00:18:45.550
defense points become 0 until 
the End Phase of this turn!

00:18:46.780 --> 00:18:49.810
I summon Blackwing – Oroshi the Squall!

00:18:51.480 --> 00:18:56.010
Level 1 Oroshi the Squall 
tunes Level 7 Armor Master!

00:18:57.490 --> 00:19:02.220
Black whirlwind, your secret 
thoughts appear on your wings!

00:19:03.360 --> 00:19:04.560
Synchro Summon!

00:19:07.620 --> 00:19:10.420
Take flight, Black-Winged Dragon!

00:19:13.310 --> 00:19:14.690
Another rare card!

00:19:14.870 --> 00:19:18.480
Since I used Oroshi the Squall as Synchro

00:19:18.480 --> 00:19:21.590
Material, Hand-Holding Genie 
switches to attack position!

00:19:23.130 --> 00:19:24.210
You're finished!

00:19:24.210 --> 00:19:27.130
Black-Winged Dragon attacks 
Hand-Holding Genie!

00:19:27.610 --> 00:19:29.400
Noble Stream!

00:19:36.240 --> 00:19:37.160
All right!

00:19:37.160 --> 00:19:37.980
He did it!

00:19:38.120 --> 00:19:40.360
That's why they're Team 5D's!

00:19:40.360 --> 00:19:45.340
With consecutive Synchro Summon attacks, 
they backed Team Taiyo into a corner!

00:19:45.560 --> 00:19:48.030
They only have one duelist left!

00:19:51.240 --> 00:19:53.170
I'm sorry, Taro.

00:19:53.170 --> 00:19:53.740
It's fine.

00:19:54.270 --> 00:19:55.970
Just three more turns.

00:19:55.970 --> 00:19:59.210
I promise to fulfill our secret strategy!

00:19:59.740 --> 00:20:01.410
Go!

00:20:01.810 --> 00:20:03.770
We're counting on you, Taro!

00:20:06.690 --> 00:20:08.860
They haven't given up.

00:20:09.130 --> 00:20:12.980
In fact, they believe 
they can turn the tables.

00:20:13.130 --> 00:20:15.130
It's currently turn 16.

00:20:15.130 --> 00:20:18.320
They only have low Level Normal 
Monsters on their field.

00:20:19.040 --> 00:20:20.310
This situation is…

00:20:22.990 --> 00:20:24.570
You're at the end of your line!

00:20:24.570 --> 00:20:27.970
Now show me how you're going to battle!

00:20:28.850 --> 00:20:30.070
Duel!

00:20:30.600 --> 00:20:32.750
Here I go!  It's my turn!

00:20:34.460 --> 00:20:36.940
I activate Speed World 2's effect!

00:20:37.620 --> 00:20:38.970
The same strategy again?

00:20:39.440 --> 00:20:46.290
By removing 4 Speed Counters, you take 800 
points of damage for every Speed Spell in my hand!

00:20:47.430 --> 00:20:50.460
Due to Black-Winged Dragon's 
effect, I can negate the

00:20:50.460 --> 00:20:53.290
damage by lowering its attack 
points by the same amount!

00:20:56.380 --> 00:20:58.440
You seem desperate.

00:20:58.440 --> 00:20:59.960
How long are you going to keep this up?

00:21:03.620 --> 00:21:07.640
Even in this situation, he's having fun.

00:21:08.580 --> 00:21:12.180
What is he planning to do?

00:21:12.880 --> 00:21:14.830
I set three cards.

00:21:15.690 --> 00:21:16.910
I end my turn!

00:21:17.670 --> 00:21:19.470
My next turn...

00:21:19.740 --> 00:21:23.740
On my next turn, our strongest 
card will finally arrive.

00:21:28.150 --> 00:21:29.840
There is one!

00:21:29.980 --> 00:21:33.850
There's one card that fits the bill.

00:21:35.780 --> 00:21:40.220
If that card appears...

00:21:42.280 --> 00:21:44.000
We may lose this duel.

00:21:49.520 --> 00:21:54.890
Close to you  Keep what's 
precious in your heart

00:21:55.360 --> 00:22:01.600
There's only one shining 
soul that's next to you

00:22:14.580 --> 00:22:19.880
You always pretend and hide your fears

00:22:20.220 --> 00:22:25.520
You act tough and don't listen to anyone

00:22:25.820 --> 00:22:31.130
You do this over and over

00:22:31.500 --> 00:22:36.870
I shouted until my soul would break

00:22:37.140 --> 00:22:42.270
Hurry up and throw that away

00:22:42.810 --> 00:22:49.780
We're only heading towards tomorrow

00:22:50.210 --> 00:22:55.520
Close to you  If you're 
trying to find yourself

00:22:55.920 --> 00:23:01.360
Just keep doing what you ultimately decided

00:23:01.530 --> 00:23:06.830
Close to you  Keep what's 
precious in your heart

00:23:07.330 --> 00:23:14.940
There's only one shining 
soul that's next to you
